# Notes
# - code/infra/credentials/ INTENTIONALLY tracked: synthetic regtest credentials, zero monetary value.
#   They are required for B9 and FM-4 to run on a clean checkout. See code/infra/README.md.
# - code/src/nostr_agent/lnd_grpc/*_pb2*.py INTENTIONALLY tracked: pre-compiled LND gRPC stubs.
#   Without them the L402 gRPC path cannot import. Regenerated by code/infra/compile_lnd_protos.sh.
# - code/eval/results/<TIMESTAMP>/ INTENTIONALLY tracked once the canonical run is chosen at submission.
